      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In the article entitled, \"Effects of Bariatric Surgery on Incidence of Obesity-Related Cancers: A Meta-Analysis\" which was published in Medical Science Monitor 2015;21: 1350-1357, sections in the text have been directly copied from a previously published article, entitled, \"The Effects of Bariatric Surgery on Colorectal Cancer Risk: Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis\", Sorena Afshar, Seamus B. Kelly, Keith Seymour, Jose Lara, Sean Woodcock, John C. Mathers  in Obesity Surgery 2014; 24(10):1793-1799. Thus owing to duplicity of text, the article is being retracted. Reference: 1. Xiang-wu Yang, Peng-zhou Li, Li-yong Zhu, Shaihong Zhu Effects of Bariatric Surgery on Incidence of Obesity-Related Cancers: A Meta-Analysis Medical Science Monitor 2015;21: 1350-1357 DOI: 10.12659/MSM.893553."},
